  - m_Id: 79254114729984
    m_Localized: 02  /  DETAILS & MOTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254118924288
    m_Localized: Details, when you need them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254131507200
    m_Localized: Hover or focus an inspection control. The detail view stays inside
      the canvas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254160867328
    m_Localized: Inspect details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254186033152
    m_Localized: A restrained reveal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254194421760
    m_Localized: Shared timings. No loops. Safe to interrupt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254219587584
    m_Localized: Show / hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254232170496
    m_Localized: 03  /  DECISIONS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254244753408
    m_Localized: A clear moment to decide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254261530624
    m_Localized: A focused dialog, with two clear actions. Background controls pause
      until it closes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254282502144
    m_Localized: Open confirmation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254295085056
    m_Localized: Arrows navigate. Submit confirms. Cancel returns focus to the opening
      control.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254307667968
    m_Localized: "Presentation only \u2014 no gameplay state or scene loading."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254320250880
    m_Localized: "Inspect the four edge markers \u2022 All text uses the EN / FR
      preview table"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254366388224
    m_Localized: Details at a glance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254366388225
    m_Localized: Heal 20 {health} to the targeted unit. Leave the control to dismiss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254538354688
    m_Localized: Confirm this action?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254538354689
    m_Localized: This is a presentation preview. Choose either action to return to
      the component library.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254546743296
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254550937600
    m_Localized: Go back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79254597074944
    m_Localized: Foundations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
